Make a melee attack dealing [144%, 163%, 177%, 189%, 200% (TL1-5)] weapon damage and attempt to snatch a foe that has 20% life or less left and swallow it whole.

While you digest it you gain [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] insanity per turn.

The digestion lasts for 50 turns for an elite and 25 turns for others.

This effect's remaining duration only goes down while in combat, and its bonuses are only applied while in combat.
